{{PROJECT_NAME}} — Licence overview

This repository contains hardware designs, firmware/software, and media/
documentation. Each is licensed separately, under the licence conventionally
used for that kind of work. The full legal text of each licence is in
[`LICENSES/`](LICENSES/); this file explains which licence applies where.

## Hardware — CERN-OHL-S v2.0

Applies to: [`cad/`](cad/), [`architecture/`](architecture/),
[`manufacturing/`](manufacturing/), [`bom/`](bom/), [`builds/`](builds/),
[`modules/`](modules/), and any other mechanical/electrical design files,
schematics, CAD models, and manufacturing drawings in this repository.

Full text: [`LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt`](LICENSES/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.txt)

## Firmware & software — GPL-3.0

Applies to: [`firmware/`](firmware/), [`software/`](software/),
[`simulation/`](simulation/), and any other source code in this repository.

Full text: [`LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt`](LICENSES/GPL-3.0.txt)

## Media & documentation — CC BY-SA 4.0

Applies to: [`docs/`](docs/), [`measurement/`](measurement/), this file, and
other project-authored text, images, drawings, and documentation.

Excluded: third-party material that is not authored by this project remains
under its original copyright and is not covered by this licence.

Full text: [`LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt`](LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt)

## Directory-level pointers

Each top-level directory listed above also contains its own short `LICENSE`
file restating which of the above applies to that directory.

